{
  "description": "Golden vectors for the window layout planner. Get-ArkuzoWindowSlots (engine) and layoutSlots (Control Center page) must both produce expected and overlap for every case. Each expected slot is [x, y, width, height]; a fifth element 1 marks a window that is minimized (arrangeOverflow 'minimize': as many windows as fit are tiled without overlap, the rest are minimized onto a tile). overlap counts only windows on screen. Inputs are the vault settings of the Accounts page and a work area at the origin in logical pixels at 100% scaling (96 DPI), with Roblox minimum window 800 x 622 and no learned minimum: the page preview works in exactly these terms. The engine additionally scales by the monitor DPI, offsets by the chosen monitor and learns larger minimums (tests/saver/NativeAccounts.Tests.ps1). Generated from the engine; change both planners together.",
